# TF_GLM_SWIGLU_SUM=0. Laptop (RTX 5070, CUDA graph, 8 weight copies, interleaved medians): -0.6 to -1.4 us a call
# (-6 to -15% of the pair) at 1-32 rows. GB10 estimate: ~1-2 us a MoE layer = 40-80 us a verify window (0.05-0.3%
# of a 27-114 ms window), unmeasured. TF_GLM_SWIGLU_SUM=0: the stock pair.
